  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When the theorist has hypothesis dice assigned to a model and makes a die roll associated with that model, the theorist may expend one of the hypothesis dice assigned to that model to gain a +2 bonus to the roll.</p>\n<p>This bonus increases by 1 at 4th level and every 4 levels thereafter. The hypothesis dice must be expended before the result of the d20 roll is revealed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/theorist#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
